        /// @dev End cycle of a LockingPosition. Maximum value of uint24 is 16M, so 16M weeks is way enough.
        uint24 lastEndCycle;
        /** @dev Percentage of the token allocated to ysCvg. Amount dedicated to vote is so equal to 100 - ysPercentage.
